{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qzWnA3tl7CCIDAzf12DZeg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:42.326921+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qzWnA3tl7CCIDAzf12DZeg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京航空航天大学航空发动机研究院接收</span><span><strong><span>推荐免试攻读2027年研究生（含博士）复试工作</span></strong></span><span>将于</span><span><strong><span>9月启动</span></strong></span><span>，具体时间待通知。请考生密切关注我院官网信息。</span><span><strong><span>复试采取现场考核，进行综合面试</span></strong></span><span>。主要考察考生思想政治素质和品德、专业外语及口语、逻辑思维及口头表达能力、专业综合素质及创新能力等。我院接收推荐免试攻读2027年研究生（含博士）工作方案请</span><span><strong><span>详见航发院官网后续通知</span></strong></span><span>，如有其他变更，请以工作方案为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/WVXUD58KPOhTOv9Ca8oIicYoIibkA9M0f712DGDASfFbQ0RKqCqxXBmicylg3T37QR4E98nlbaABW4G9CAOVbWcIiaZS7xoo8EtMqJicUg6fvAv8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>研究院介绍</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>航空发动机研究院和航空发动机国际学院</span></strong><span>（简称“两院”）于2018年12月15日签约成立，由北京航空航天大学（简称北航）和中国航空发动机集团有限公司（简称中国航发）联合打造科研攻关和人才培养特区。</span></p><p><span>2024年12月，</span><strong><span>北航</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>中国航发</span></strong><span>联合</span><strong><span>太行实验室</span></strong><span>共同签署“两院” 共建协议，实现一流大学、龙头企业和高端研究机构的有力衔接。三方以国家重大科技专项实施为契机， 整合多年的研究积累和资源投入，</span><span><strong><span>采用“强强联合、深度融合、紧密协同”的原则，积极探索校企协同创新机制</span></strong></span><span>，引入协同决策机制、融合攻关机制、联合考评机制、互补投入机制和协作育人机制，积极探索核心技术攻关、校企协同创新、一流人才自主培养和学科交叉融合的四条新路，携手打造航空发动机领域战略科技力量，攻克航空发动机领域难题。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WVXUD58KPOgyu46KiakXicbtsdPg3el981RMM80OXTtk5GiawuZzKriaQZUyu6nGZicH9OSI0LKaKbu4fQLWHcKqCBciblw5TiaFq8FXJtGTH9UYNs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资队伍及团队介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>航空发动机研究院师资队伍及团队介绍，请详见</span><span><strong><span>官网</span></strong></span><span>或</span><span><strong><span>点击文末</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>阅读原文</span></strong></span><span>查看：</span></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>https://riae.buaa.edu.cn</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WVXUD58KPOhXYxZRKnXM4TvVL4AzER9XMHiciaOfxCD5hsjIC51TEicOmKccTbFiafwF1siciaUAIl1nJGFia08NoBDPAFRNuC9hfPgfYCBhT4JAdY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>诚挚欢迎<